# /deploy command

When the user types `/deploy`, immediately read and follow the skill at `/Users/lydiashan/.cursor/skills/deploy-to-vercel/SKILL.md`.

Do not ask for confirmation. Execute the full workflow:
1. Run `git status`, `git diff`, `git diff --cached`, `git log --oneline -5` in parallel
2. Stage all changes with `git add -A`
3. Generate a descriptive commit message from the diff
4. Commit with that message
5. Push to `origin main`
6. Report the commit message and confirm Vercel will auto-deploy
